{"corpus":"ccc","number":333,"text_html":"<span>De l’Incarnation à l’Ascension, la vie du Verbe incarné est entourée de l’adoration et du service des anges. Lorsque Dieu « introduit le Premier-né dans le monde, il dit : ‘Que tous les anges de Dieu l’adorent’ » <sup class=\"srcRef bibleRef\" data-idx=\"1\">1</sup>. Leur chant de louange à la naissance du Christ n’a cessé de résonner dans la louange de l’Église : « Gloire à Dieu... » <sup class=\"srcRef bibleRef\" data-idx=\"2\">2</sup>. Ils protègent l’enfance de Jésus<sup class=\"srcRef cccRef\">§559</sup> <sup class=\"srcRef bibleRef\" data-idx=\"3\">3</sup>, servent Jésus au désert <sup class=\"srcRef bibleRef\" data-idx=\"6\">4</sup>, le réconfortent dans l’agonie <sup class=\"srcRef bibleRef\" data-idx=\"8\">5</sup>, alors qu’il aurait pu être sauvé par eux de la main des ennemis <sup class=\"srcRef bibleRef\" data-idx=\"9\">6</sup> comme jadis Israël <sup class=\"srcRef bibleRef\" data-idx=\"10\">7</sup>. Ce sont encore les anges qui « évangélisent » <sup class=\"srcRef bibleRef\" data-idx=\"12\">8</sup> en annonçant la Bonne Nouvelle de l’Incarnation <sup class=\"srcRef bibleRef\" data-idx=\"13\">9</sup>, et de la Résurrection <sup class=\"srcRef bibleRef\" data-idx=\"14\">10</sup> du Christ. Ils seront là au retour du Christ qu’ils annoncent <sup class=\"srcRef bibleRef\" data-idx=\"15\">11</sup>, au service de son jugement <sup class=\"srcRef bibleRef\" data-idx=\"16\">12</sup>.</span>","cross_refs":["559"],"bible_refs":[{"text":"He 1:6"},{"text":"Lc 2:14"},{"text":"Mt 1:20"},{"text":"Mt 2:13"},{"text":"Mt 2:19"},{"text":"Mc 1:12"},{"text":"Mt 4:11"},{"text":"Lc 22:43"},{"text":"Mt 26:53"},{"text":"Mt 2 M 10:29-30"},{"text":"Mt 11:8"},{"text":"Lc 2:10"},{"text":"Lc 2:8-14"},{"text":"Mc 16:5-7"},{"text":"Ac 1:10-11"},{"text":"Mt 13:41"},{"text":"Mt 24:31"},{"text":"Lc 12:8-9"}],"citations":[],"magisterial_refs":[{"type":"bible","raw":"He 1:6","idx":1,"display_idx":1},{"type":"bible","raw":"Lc 2:14","idx":2,"display_idx":2},{"type":"bible","raw":"voir Mt 1:20","idx":3,"display_idx":3},{"type":"bible_continuation","raw":"2:13","idx":4,"marker_idx":3,"display_idx":3},{"type":"bible_continuation","raw":"2:19","idx":5,"marker_idx":3,"display_idx":3},{"type":"bible","raw":"voir Mc 1:12","idx":6,"display_idx":4},{"type":"bible","raw":"Mt 4:11","idx":7,"marker_idx":6,"display_idx":4},{"type":"bible","raw":"voir Lc 22:43","idx":8,"display_idx":5},{"type":"bible","raw":"voir Mt 26:53","idx":9,"display_idx":6},{"type":"bible","raw":"voir 2 M 10:29-30","idx":10,"display_idx":7},{"type":"bible_continuation","raw":"11:8","idx":11,"marker_idx":10,"display_idx":7},{"type":"bible","raw":"Lc 2:10","idx":12,"display_idx":8},{"type":"bible","raw":"voir Lc 2:8-14","idx":13,"display_idx":9},{"type":"bible","raw":"voir Mc 16:5-7","idx":14,"display_idx":10},{"type":"bible","raw":"voir Ac 1:10-11","idx":15,"display_idx":11},{"type":"bible","raw":"voir Mt 13:41","idx":16,"display_idx":12},{"type":"bible_continuation","raw":"24:31","idx":17,"marker_idx":16,"display_idx":12},{"type":"bible","raw":"Lc 12:8-9","idx":18,"marker_idx":16,"display_idx":12}]}